data: {"type":"sub_session","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sg2ooLzSEZXoXMnEKd4HXu","agent":"puls","event":"content_block_start","data":{"type":"content_block_start","index":13,"content_block":{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01QA7ghjWN89jART58RDgrm4","content":"Search results for 'Checkers full cream fresh milk 1L price' on checkers.co.za (via Tavily):\n\n1. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-long-life-full-cream-milk-1l-10156094EA\n   Image of Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L - view 1\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L - view 2\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L\n\nR17.99\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\n## Specification [...] | | |\n --- |\n| Benefits & Features | Creamy texture Versatile use in cooking, baking, and beverages Rich taste Long shelf life |\n| Allergens | Contains: Milk. |\n| Ingredients | Full Cream Milk | [...] | Nutritional Information | Per 100g/ml Energy: 281kJ Protein: 3.7g Carbohydrates: 5.3g • Of which total sugar: 5.3g Total fat: 3.5g • Of which saturated fat: 2.4g Dietary fibre: 0.5g Total sodium: 47mg Per Serving (250ml) Energy: 703kJ Protein: 9.3g Carbohydrates: 13.3g • Of which total sugar: 13.3g Total fat: 8.5g • Of which saturated fat: 6.0g Dietary fibre: 0.5g Total sodium: 118mg |\n| Serving Size | 250ml |\n| Halaal | Yes |\n| Kosher | Yes |\n\n2. Checkers Sixty60 | UHT Milk & Dairy Alternatives\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/merchandised-page/uht-milk-and-dairy-alternatives-65e5e182622beb1464f9c583\n   # UHT Milk & Dairy Alternatives\n\nUHT Milk & Dairy Alternatives\n\n## Long Life Milk\n\nView All Long Life Milk\n\nCheckers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk 1L\n\nR17.99\n\nCheckers Housebrand Long