data: {"type":"sub_session","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sg2ooLzSEZXoXMnEKd4HXu","agent":"puls","event":"content_block_start","data":{"type":"content_block_start","index":14,"content_block":{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Cw4e5C38VAact7Jb9M7CFd","content":"Search results for 'Checkers large eggs 6 pack price' on checkers.co.za (via Tavily):\n\n1. Checkers Sixty60 | Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/simple-truth-large-free-range-eggs-6-pack-10720825EA\n   Home\n Milk, Dairy & Eggs\n Eggs\n Simple Truth Large Free-R...\n\nImage of Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack\n\nImage of Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack\n\nImage of Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack\n\n# Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack\n\nR29.99\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\nSimple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack contains eggs sourced from humanely-reared chickens that are free to roam outdoors. [...] Start your day right with Simple Truth Large Free-Range Eggs 6 Pack. Enjoy the taste of eggs from hens that roam outdoors and are fed only on grains and pulses.\n\n## Specification\n\n| | |\n --- |\n| Allergens | Contains Eggs |\n| Ingredients | |\n| Vitality Product | |\n| Egg Size | |\n| Free Range | Yes |\n\n2. Checkers Sixty60 | Nulaid Extra Large Eggs 6-Pack\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/nulaid-extra-large-eggs-6-pack-10142967EA\n   Home\n Milk, Dairy & Eggs\n Eggs\n Nulaid Extra Large Eggs 6...\n\n# Nulaid Extra Large Eggs 6-Pack\n\nR27.99\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\nEggs are eaten everyday around the world. People make eggs in so many different ways. Get 6 X-Large eggs that are completely fresh, because they're better that way. [...] Nulaid Extra Large Eggs 6 Pack come with 6 X-Large eggs perfect for you and your family. These Grade 1 eggs are produced in South Africa where the grain-fed hens lay the freshest eggs specially for you.\n\n## Specification\n\n| | |\n --- |\n| Allergens | Eggs |\n| Ingredients | Eggs |\n| Rations | 6 |\n| Vitality Product | Yes |\n| Egg Size | Extra Large |\n| What's in the box? | 6 x Nulaid Extra Large Eggs |\n\n3. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 48 Pack\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-large-eggs-48-pack-10710097EA\n   Home\n Milk, Dairy & Eggs\n Eggs\n Checkers Housebrand Large...\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 48 Pack\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 48 Pack\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 48 Pack\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 48 Pack\n\nSAVE R30\n\nR139.99\n\nR169.99\n\nDeal expires 15 Nov 2026\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information [...] Catering to all your culinary requirements Checkers Eggs offers a convenient and versatile option for your kitchen needs. Each pack contains 48 large eggs, perfect for various culinary uses. Whether you're poaching, frying, baking, cooking, or boiling, these eggs add rich flavour to your dishes. Ideal for everyday meals and special recipes, they provide a reliable ingredient for breakfast, lunch, dinner, and desserts. Plus, the large size of the eggs ensures ample volume and consistency in your [...] Enjoy the convenience and versatility of these eggs which offer a reliable option for all your cooking and baking needs. This pack of 48 large eggs is perfect for poaching, frying, baking, and more, adding rich flavour to your dishes. Conveniently packaged for easy storage, these eggs ensure you always have a staple ingredient on hand for various recipes and meals.\n\n4. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs 6 Pack\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-large-eggs-6-pack-5e567025fbb3dee6430ba03e\n   Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs offer a convenient 6 pack of protein-rich, versatile eggs, perfect for everyday cooking and baking. Sourced with care, these large eggs are an excellent choice for a nutritious breakfast, a quick meal, or an essential ingredient in your favourite recipes, bringing quality to your kitchen. [...] Checkers Housebrand Large Eggs provide a superb 6 pack, ideal for any British household seeking quality and value. These protein-rich large eggs are incredibly versatile, perfect for optimising your breakfast omelette, scrambling for a quick lunch, or baking delicious cakes and pastries. Organise your weekly meal plan around these essential kitchen staples, knowing you are choosing a reliable and nutritious product. Each egg in this pack offers a natural source of vital nutrients, making them a [...] making them a healthy addition to any diet. Enjoy the convenience and trusted quality of Checkers Housebrand for all your culinary needs, ensuring a satisfying and wholesome experience every time you cook with these reliable eggs.\n\n5. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs 18 Pack\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-extra-large-eggs-18-pack-10664953EA\n   Home\n Milk, Dairy & Eggs\n Eggs\n Checkers Housebrand Extra...\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs 18 Pack\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs 18 Pack\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs 18 Pack\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs 18 Pack\n\nSAVE R10\n\nR59.99\n\nR69.99\n\nDeal expires 15 Nov 2026\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information [...] | Vitality Product | |\n| Egg Size | Extra Large |\n| What's in the box? | 1 x 18 Checkers Housebrand Extra Large Eggs | [...] Make the most wholesome breakfasts with our grade-1 extra-large eggs. The eggs are highly nutritious and offer a fantastic source of protein.\n\nThese extra-large eggs are an essential must-have in millions of homes across the country and are exceptionally versatile. The eggs can be baked, fried, boiled, or used in countless cooking and baking recipes. There are 18 eggs included in this grade 1 pack.\n\n## Specification","is_error":false}}}

