data: {"type":"sub_session","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sg2ooLzSEZXoXMnEKd4HXu","agent":"puls","event":"content_block_start","data":{"type":"content_block_start","index":17,"content_block":{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01ScUw4rd6cKYyRrh5bdMwEs","content":"Search results for 'Checkers table salt 750g price' on checkers.co.za (via Tavily):\n\n1. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 1kg\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-table-salt-1kg-10157633EA\n   Home\n Food Cupboard\n Herbs, Spices & Seasoning\n Salt & Pepper\n Checkers Housebrand Table...\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 1kg\n\nImage of Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 1kg\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 1kg\n\nR13.99\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\nCheckers Housebrand Table Salt is for cooking, baking, and seasoning. It enhances natural food flavours and is essential in food preservation methods like brining and curing. [...] Checkers Housebrand Table Salt is iodated, halaal and kosher certified, making it suitable for many dietary needs. Essential for cooking, baking, and seasoning, this versatile salt enhances flavours and preserves food. It is ideal for everyday use, bringing out the best in meats, vegetables, starches, and desserts.\n\n## Specification [...] | | |\n --- |\n| Benefits & Features | Fine-grained texture for easy mixing and dissolving Suitable for cooking, baking, and seasoning dishes Can be used for food preservation methods such as brining and curing Versatile and suitable for a wide range of culinary applications Helps preserve food by inhibiting spoilage and extending shelf life |\n| Ingredients | Salt, Potassium lodate |\n\n2. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 500g\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-table-salt-500g-10157632EA\n   Home\n Food Cupboard\n Herbs, Spices & Seasoning\n Salt & Pepper\n Checkers Housebrand Table...\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Table Salt 500g\n\nR7.99\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\nCheckers Housebrand Table Salt is essential for cooking, baking, and seasoning. It brings out the natural taste of ingredients and is perfect for everyday use at the table or in meal preparation. [...] | Kosher | Yes |\n| What's in the box? | 1 x 500g Checkers Housebrand Table Salt | [...] Checkers Housebrand Table Salt is an iodised salt ideal for cooking, baking, and seasoning. It enhances flavour, preserves food, and provides essential iodine for thyroid health. This versatile salt brings out the best in your dishes, making it a staple in any kitchen.\n\n## Specification\n\n3. Checkers Sixty60 | Checkers Housebrand Iodated Coarse Salt 1kg\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/checkers-housebrand-iodated-coarse-salt-1kg-10752866EA\n   Home\n Food Cupboard\n Herbs, Spices & Seasoning\n Salt & Pepper\n Checkers Housebrand Iodat...\n\n# Checkers Housebrand Iodated Coarse Salt 1kg\n\nR13.99\n\n1\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information [...] Checkers Housebrand Iodated Coarse Salt is a versatile kitchen staple that combines dependability with everyday convenience. The coarse texture and added iodine make it a practical choice for flavourful meals and well-stocked spice racks, perfectly suitable for a wide range of cooking and seasoning needs. [...] | | |\n --- |\n| Benefits & Features | • Coarse salt texture delivers consistent seasoning for a variety of dishes • Versatile pantry staple supports a wide range of cooking & food preparation needs • Simple formulation makes seasoning easy & convenient • Essential spice rack addition helps keep kitchens stocked with a trusted flavour enhancer |\n| Ingredients | Sodium Chloride, Potassium Iodate (E917) |\n\n4. Checkers Sixty60 | Cerebos Iodated Table Salt Pack 1kg\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/cerebos-iodated-table-salt-pack-1kg-10143951EA\n   Image of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt Pack 1kg\nImage of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt Pack 1kg - view 1\n\n# Cerebos Iodated Table Salt Pack 1kg\n\nR24.99\n\nDeal expires 08 Nov 2026\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\n5. Checkers Sixty60 | Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg\n   https://www.checkers.co.za/product/cerebos-iodated-table-salt-20-x-1kg-10143951PK1\n   Image of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg\nImage of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg\nImage of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg - view 1\nImage of Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg - view 2\n\n# Cerebos Iodated Table Salt 20 x 1kg\n\nR469.99\n\n## In case your 1st choice is out of stock...\n\n## Related Products\n\n## Product Information\n\n## Specification [...] ## Specification\n\n| | |\n --- |\n| Benefits & Features | • Fine grain texture for easy dissolving • Versatile for cooking, baking, and preservation • Resealable packaging to maintain freshness • Essential for food preservation techniques like brining and pickling • Improves dough leavening and flavour balance in baking • Accents and deepens the flavour of various foods |\n| What's in the box? | 20 x 1kg Cerebos Iodated Table Salt |\n\n20 x 1kg Cerebos Iodated Table Salt","is_error":false}}}

