d beverages\n\n- Rich taste\n\n- Long shelf life\n\nAllergens\nContains: Milk.\n\nIngredients\nFull Cream Milk\n\nNutritional Information\nPer 100g/ml\n\n- Energy: 281kJ\n\n- Protein: 3.7g\n\n- Carbohydrates: 5.3g\n\n- • Of which total sugar: 5.3g\n\n- Total fat: 3.5g\n\n- • Of which saturated fat: 2.4g\n\n- Dietary fibre: 0.5g\n\n- Total sodium: 47mg\n\nPer Serving (250ml)\n\n- Energy: 703kJ\n\n- Protein: 9.3g\n\n- Carbohydrates: 13.3g\n\n- • Of which total sugar: 13.3g\n\n- Total fat: 8.5g\n\n- • Of which saturated fat: 6.0g\n\n- Dietary fibre: 0.5g\n\n- Total sodium: 118mg\n\nServing Size\n250ml\n\nHalaal\nYes\n\nKosher\nYes\n\nWhat's in the box?\n1 x 1L Checkers Housebrand Long Life Full Cream Milk\n--- end of web content ---","is_error":false}}}

